<title>JAPAN: Tokai Konetsu Kogyo - 1996 parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokai Konetsu Kogyo - 1996 parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.52		vs	    6.25</p>
<p> Operating	  110    million	  vs	  165    million</p>
<p> Current	    143    million	  vs	  176    million</p>
<p> Net		   72    million	  vs	   86    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.30 yen	  vs	    5.13 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     17 million	  vs	  17 million</p>
<p> Ord div		4.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokai Konetsu Kogyo Co Ltd is a large maker of silicon carbide heating elements and heating equipment. Its net was down 16.3 pct.</p>
</text>
